                    rag:
      rate-limit:
        global:
          enabled: true
          max-concurrent: 3        # 演示用 3 个许可
          max-wait-seconds: 20
          lease-seconds: 600
          poll-interval-ms: 200

|         参数         |       含义        |                  经验值                  |
|--------------------|-----------------|---------------------------------------|
